  /* Star layers are hidden in the base state (`opacity: 0`) so that under
     `prefers-reduced-motion: reduce` the section stays pixel-identical to the
     reference PNG. The living sky is opt-in inside the `no-preference` media
     query below: only `transform`/`opacity` animate (compositor), and each star
     layer drifts one full background tile per loop so the wrap is seamless. The
     layer `inset` is kept larger than its tile so the sliding box always covers
     the section. The mid layer stays disabled (two drifting layers + glow keep
     the compositing cost low). */
